---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout
    title="Utila Island | Beach Cleanups"
    description="Utila Island Cleanups is a community-led non-profit dedicated to beach cleanups and protecting marine life in Utila, Honduras. Join us every Wednesday morning."
    keywords="Utila, Honduras, beach cleanup, marine conservation, Swamper iguana, sea turtles, environmental awareness, Off the Dock Adventures, Utila beach clean, Utila beach cleanups, Honduras conservation, Swamper iguana Utila, sea turtle nesting Utila, Off the Dock Adventures, Circle K Utila"
    ogTitle="Utila Island Cleanups | Creating Awareness One Cleanup at a Time | Utila Island Cleanups - Join the Weekly Movement"
    ogDescription="Weekly beach cleanups in Utila, Honduras to preserve vital coastal ecosystems."
>
    <Navbar />

    <div id="announcement-banner" class="announcement-banner" hidden></div>

    <header id="home" class="hero">
        <div class="hero-overlay">
            <h1 data-en="Creating awareness one beach cleanup at a time" data-es="Creamos consciencia ambiental una limpieza de playa a la vez" data-fr="Créer une prise de conscience, une plage nettoyée à la fois">Creating awareness one beach cleanup at a time</h1>
            <p data-en="We are a grassroots movement dedicated to protecting our shorelines through hands-on cleanups, responsible waste removal, community engagement, and environmental awareness."
               data-es="Somos un movimiento comunitario dedicado a proteger nuestras costas mediante limpiezas prácticas, remoción responsable de residuos, participación comunitaria y concienciación ambiental."
               data-fr="Nous sommes un mouvement communautaire dédié à la protection de notre littoral grâce à des nettoyages pratiques, une élimination responsable des déchets, l'engagement communautaire et la sensibilisation environnementale.">
               We are a grassroots movement dedicated to protecting our shorelines through hands-on cleanups, responsible waste removal, community engagement, and environmental awareness.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-buttons">
                <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline" data-en="Learn More" data-es="Saber más" data-fr="En savoir plus">Learn More</a>
                <a href="/get-involved" class="btn btn-outline" data-en="Get Involved" data-es="Participa" data-fr="Participer">Get Involved</a>
            </div>
            <p class="hero-location" data-en="Utila, Bay Islands, Honduras" data-es="Utila, Islas de la Bahía, Honduras" data-fr="Utila, îles de la Baie, Honduras">Utila, Bay Islands, Honduras</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="mission-statement container">
    <div class="mission-content">
        <h2 data-en="Our Mission: Preserving Utila's Coastline"
            data-es="Nuestra Misión: Preservando la Costa de Utila" data-fr="Notre mission : préserver le littoral d'Utila">
            Our Mission: Preserving Utila's Coastline
        </h2>

        <p class="mission-lead" data-en="Utila Island Cleanups is a community-led conservation initiative dedicated to the restoration and protection of the island's most fragile marine ecosystems. Through consistent action and local collaboration, we tackle the global plastic crisis at a grassroots level."
           data-es="Utila Island Cleanups es una iniciativa de conservación liderada por la comunidad, dedicada a la restauración y protección de los ecosistemas marinos más frágiles de la isla." data-fr="Utila Island Cleanups est une initiative de conservation menée par la communauté, dédiée à la restauration et à la protection des écosystèmes marins les plus fragiles de l'île. Grâce à une action constante et à la collaboration locale, nous luttons contre la crise mondiale du plastique à la base.">
           Utila Island Cleanups is a community-led conservation initiative dedicated to the restoration and protection of the island's most fragile marine ecosystems.
        </p>

        <div class="mission-pillars">
            <div class="pillar">
                <h4 data-en="Strategic Habitat Restoration" data-es="Restauración Estratégica del Hábitat" data-fr="Restauration stratégique de l'habitat">
                    Strategic Habitat Restoration
                </h4>
                <p data-en="Our foundation is built on consistency. We host weekly Wednesday cleanups to maintain Utila’s accessible coastlines year-round. Our mission is to scale these efforts into intensive 'North Shore Missions'—a dedicated series of 4 deep-clean cleanups every trimester—specifically designed to clear nesting grounds for the endangered Swamper Iguana and Hawksbill Sea Turtles as funding permits."
                data-es="Nuestra base es la consistencia. Realizamos limpiezas todos los miércoles para mantener las costas accesibles de Utila durante todo el año. Nuestra meta es escalar estos esfuerzos hacia 'Misiones de la Costa Norte' (una serie de 4 limpiezas intensivas cada trimestre) diseñadas para limpiar las zonas de anidación de la Iguana Swamper y las Tortugas Carey, según la disponibilidad de fondos." data-fr="Notre fondation repose sur la constance. Nous organisons des nettoyages hebdomadaires tous les mercredis pour entretenir les côtes accessibles d'Utila tout au long de l'année. Notre mission est de développer ces efforts en « Missions de la côte nord » intensives, une série dédiée de 4 nettoyages approfondis chaque trimestre, spécialement conçues pour dégager les sites de nidification de l'Iguane des marais et des tortues imbriquées menacés, selon les fonds disponibles.">
                Our foundation is built on consistency. We host weekly Wednesday cleanups to maintain Utila’s accessible coastlines year-round, with the goal of expanding to intensive North Shore Missions each trimester as funding permits.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="pillar">
                <h4 data-en="Circular Waste Management" data-es="Gestión Circular de Residuos" data-fr="Gestion circulaire des déchets">Circular Waste Management</h4>
                <p data-en="Our mission extends beyond the beach. Through our partnership with Recycle Honduras, we ensure that collected plastics are removed from the island and processed responsibly on the mainland."
                   data-es="Nuestra misión se extiende más allá de la playa. A través de nuestra alianza con Recycle Honduras, aseguramos que los plásticos recolectados salgan de la isla." data-fr="Notre mission va au-delà de la plage. Grâce à notre partenariat avec Recycle Honduras, nous veillons à ce que les plastiques collectés soient retirés de l'île et traités de manière responsable sur le continent.">
                   We ensure that collected plastics are removed from the island and processed responsibly on the mainland via Recycle Honduras.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="pillar">
                <h4 data-en="Environmental Advocacy" data-es="Defensa Ambiental" data-fr="Sensibilisation environnementale">Environmental Advocacy</h4>
                <p data-en="By organizing weekly cleanup missions every Wednesday, we foster a culture of environmental stewardship among Utila's residents, divers, and international visitors."
                   data-es="Al organizar misiones de limpieza todos los miércoles, fomentamos una cultura de administración ambiental entre residentes y visitantes." data-fr="En organisant des missions de nettoyage hebdomadaires tous les mercredis, nous favorisons une culture de responsabilité environnementale parmi les résidents, plongeurs et visiteurs internationaux d'Utila.">
                   By organizing missions every Wednesday, we foster a culture of environmental stewardship among residents and visitors.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="uic-values bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="text-center" data-en="The Values That Drive Us" data-es="Los Valores Que Nos Impulsan" data-fr="Les valeurs qui nous animent">
            The Values That Drive Us
        </h2>
        <p class="text-center subtitle" data-en="At Utila Island Cleanups, we operate with a clear set of principles to ensure our impact is lasting and meaningful."
           data-es="En Utila Island Cleanups, operamos con un conjunto claro de principios para asegurar que nuestro impacto sea duradero y significativo." data-fr="Chez Utila Island Cleanups, nous agissons selon des principes clairs pour garantir un impact durable et significatif.">
           At Utila Island Cleanups, we operate with a clear set of principles to ensure our impact is lasting and meaningful.
        </p>

        <div class="values-grid">
            <div class="value-card">
                <ion-icon name="shield-checkmark-outline"></ion-icon>
                <h3 data-en="Accountability" data-es="Responsabilidad" data-fr="Responsabilité">Accountability</h3>
                <p data-en="We don't just move trash; we manage it. From the North Shore to Recycle Honduras, we take full responsibility for every kilogram we collect."
                   data-es="No solo movemos la basura; la gestionamos. Desde la Costa Norte hasta Recycle Honduras, asumimos la responsabilidad total de cada kilogramo." data-fr="Nous ne nous contentons pas de déplacer les déchets ; nous les gérons. De la côte nord jusqu'à Recycle Honduras, nous assumons l'entière responsabilité de chaque kilogramme collecté.">
                   We take full responsibility for the lifecycle of the waste we collect.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="value-card">
                <ion-icon name="people-outline"></ion-icon>
                <h3 data-en="Community First" data-es="Comunidad Primero" data-fr="La communauté avant tout">Community First</h3>
                <p data-en="UIC belongs to Utila. We foster collaboration between locals, businesses like Off the Dock Adventures, and international visitors to protect our shared home."
                   data-es="UIC pertenece a Utila. Fomentamos la colaboración entre locales, empresas y visitantes internacionales para proteger nuestro hogar compartido." data-fr="UIC appartient à Utila. Nous favorisons la collaboration entre les habitants, des entreprises comme Off the Dock Adventures et les visiteurs internationaux pour protéger notre foyer commun.">
                   We believe conservation is a collective effort between locals and visitors.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="value-card">
                <ion-icon name="stats-chart-outline"></ion-icon>
                <h3 data-en="Radical Transparency" data-es="Transparencia Radical" data-fr="Transparence radicale">Radical Transparency</h3>
                <p data-en="Through our live impact dashboard and open data, we prove our progress every week. We want our supporters to see exactly where their energy goes."
                   data-es="A través de nuestro tablero de impacto en vivo y datos abiertos, demostramos nuestro progreso cada semana." data-fr="Grâce à notre tableau de bord d'impact en direct et à nos données ouvertes, nous prouvons nos progrès chaque semaine. Nous voulons que nos soutiens voient exactement où va leur énergie.">
                   We share live data and results so our supporters see the real impact of their work.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="info-section bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 data-en="Protecting Utila's Unique Biodiversity" data-es="Protegiendo la Biodiversidad Única de Utila" data-fr="Protéger la biodiversité unique d'Utila">
            Protecting Utila's Unique Biodiversity
        </h2>
        <div class="info-grid">
            <div class="info-card">

                <h3 data-en="The Swamper Iguana" data-es="La Iguana Swamper" data-fr="L'Iguane des marais">The Swamper Iguana</h3>
                <span class="scientific-name" style="font-style: italic; color: #365b6d; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;">Ctenosaura bakeri</span>
                <p data-en="This critically endangered species is found only on Utila. Swampers depend on sandy beaches to reproduce, as females dig nests in warm sand to lay their eggs. Pollution and human disturbance directly threaten their ability to reproduce and puts the future of this unique species at risk."
                   data-es="Esta especie en peligro crítico se encuentra solo en Utila. Las iguanas Swamper dependen de las playas de arena para reproducirse, ya que las hembras cavan nidos en la arena cálida. La contaminación y la actividad humana amenazan directamente su futuro." data-fr="Cette espèce en danger critique d'extinction ne se trouve qu'à Utila. Les iguanes des marais dépendent des plages de sable pour se reproduire, les femelles creusant des nids dans le sable chaud pour y pondre leurs œufs. La pollution et les perturbations humaines menacent directement leur capacité à se reproduire et mettent en péril l'avenir de cette espèce unique.">
                    The Swamper depends on sandy beaches to reproduce; pollution and disturbance directly threaten the future of this unique species.
                </p>
                <div class="fact-box" style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 0.85rem; background: #eef7fb; padding: 10px; border-left: 3px solid #289dd2;">
                    <p><strong>Did You Know?</strong> The Swamper is the only iguana in the world that lives in mangroves but must migrate to the beach to nest.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-card">

                <h3 data-en="Sea Turtle Nesting" data-es="Anidación de Tortugas" data-fr="Nidification des tortues marines">Sea Turtle Nesting</h3>
                <span class="scientific-name" style="font-style: italic; color: #365b6d; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;">Eretmochelys imbricata & Caretta caretta</span>
                <p data-en="Utila is a vital nesting site for Hawksbill and Loggerhead turtles. Both rely on quiet, sandy shores to lay eggs above the high tide line at night. Coastal development, pollution, and artificial lighting disrupt nesting cycles and disorient hatchlings as they try to find the sea."
                   data-es="Utila es un sitio de anidación vital para las tortugas Carey y Caguama. Ambas dependen de orillas arenosas y tranquilas. La contaminación y la iluminación artificial interrumpen la anidación y desorientan a las crías." data-fr="Utila est un site de nidification essentiel pour les tortues imbriquées et les tortues caouannes. Toutes deux dépendent de rivages sablonneux et tranquilles pour pondre leurs œufs au-dessus de la ligne de marée haute, la nuit. Le développement côtier, la pollution et l'éclairage artificiel perturbent les cycles de nidification et désorientent les nouveau-nés lorsqu'ils cherchent à rejoindre la mer.">
                    Coastal pollution and artificial lighting disrupt nesting cycles and disorient Hawksbill and Loggerhead hatchlings.
                </p>
                <div class="fact-box" style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 0.85rem; background: #eef7fb; padding: 10px; border-left: 3px solid #289dd2;">
                    <p><strong>Did You Know?</strong> Hatchlings use the moon's reflection to find the ocean. Artificial lights can lead them inland toward danger.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

    <section id="wednesday-info" class="bg-alt">
        <div class="container info-grid">
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3 data-en="When" data-es="Cuándo" data-fr="Quand">When</h3>
                <p data-en="Every Wednesday, 7:00 AM - 8:45 AM" data-es="Todos los miércoles, 7:00 AM - 8:45 AM" data-fr="Tous les mercredis, 7h00 - 8h45">Every Wednesday, 7:00 AM - 8:45 AM</p>
            </div>
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3 data-en="Where" data-es="Dónde" data-fr="Où">Where</h3>
                <p data-en="Meet at Circle K" data-es="Punto de encuentro: Circle K" data-fr="Rendez-vous au Circle K">Meet at Circle K</p>
            </div>
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3 data-en="Provided" data-es="Proporcionado" data-fr="Fourni">Provided</h3>
                <p data-en="Transport, water, fruit, and materials" data-es="Transporte, agua, fruta y materiales" data-fr="Transport, eau, fruits et matériel">Transport, water, fruit, and materials</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

            <section class="home-impact-dashboard">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="dashboard-intro">
            <h2 data-en="Our Real-Time Impact" data-es="Nuestro Impacto en Tiempo Real" data-fr="Notre impact en temps réel">Our Real-Time Impact</h2>
            <p data-en="Every cleanup, we track every bottle and every pound removed from Utila's shores to protect our local wildlife."
               data-es="En cada limpieza, registramos cada botella y cada libra retirada de las costas de Utila para proteger nuestra fauna local." data-fr="À chaque nettoyage, nous comptabilisons chaque bouteille et chaque livre retirée des côtes d'Utila pour protéger notre faune locale.">
               Every cleanup, we track every bottle and every pound removed from Utila's shores to protect our local wildlife.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="impact-stats-row">
            <div class="metric-box">
                <div class="metric-value">
                    <span class="counter" id="count-bottles" data-target="13318">13318</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric-label" data-en="Bottles Removed" data-es="Botellas Retiradas" data-fr="Bouteilles retirées">
                    Bottles Removed
                </div>
                <div class="metric-bar bottle-bar"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="metric-box">
                <div class="metric-value">
                    <span class="counter" id="count-weight-kg" data-target="2240.4">2240.4</span><small>kg</small>
                </div>
                <div class="metric-label" data-en="Weight (KG)" data-es="Peso (KG)" data-fr="Poids (KG)">
                    Weight (KG)
                </div>
                <div class="metric-bar weight-bar"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="metric-box">
                <div class="metric-value">
                    <span class="counter" id="count-weight-lbs" data-target="4939.3">4939.3</span><small>lbs</small>
                </div>
                <div class="metric-label" data-en="Weight (LBS)" data-es="Peso (LBS)" data-fr="Poids (LBS)">
                    Weight (LBS)
                </div>
                <div class="metric-bar weight-lbs-bar"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="metric-box">
                <div class="metric-value">
                    <span class="counter" id="count-cleanups" data-target="17">17</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric-label" data-en="Total Cleanups" data-es="Total de Limpiezas" data-fr="Nettoyages au total">
                    Total Cleanups
                </div>
                <div class="metric-bar mission-bar"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="dashboard-cta">
            <a href="/impact" class="btn btn-impact" data-en="Explore Full Impact Data" data-es="Explorar Datos de Impacto Completos" data-fr="Explorer toutes les données d'impact">
                Explore Full Impact Data
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

    <Footer />

    <script>
        import '../scripts/live-counters.js';
    </script>
</Layout>
